# PORTFOLIO: {{^-o$}}
# PORTFOLIO-NEXT: {{.*}}/linker/portfolio.elf
# PORTFOLIO: -working-directory={{.*}}
# PORTFOLIO: -x
# PORTFOLIO-NEXT: c
# PORTFOLIO: {{.*}}test/applications/vecadd-memory/vecadd_memory.c
# PARTIAL: portfolio manifest, repository, application, and input must be selected together
# OVERRIDE: a portfolio selection derives its exact sources and compiler options from the manifest
# CONTINUITY: portfolio selections must retain compile-to-Deployment continuity through loom-cc
# PROTOCOL-OWNER: a portfolio selection derives operator protocol symbols from the manifest
# TARGET-CONFLICT: manifest compiler option '--target=x86_64' conflicts with product-owned compiler target policy
# LIBRARY-CONFLICT: manifest link option '-lz' names a library unavailable to the product freestanding runtime
# PROFILE: product source binding supports exactly zero warm-up samples and one measured sample; the bounded host profile remains independently executable
